[{:adr/consequences ["aiueos broker authenticate()/verify_one adds registry lookup; CID-pinned registry is cacheable" "append-only registry authority itself must be scoped by issuer_trusted_for" "existing manifest signature ({id}\\n{wasm_sha256} over ed25519) is unchanged; trust store sits above it"], :adr/authoritative_for ["mature aiueos signer registry from flat list to versioned/expiring trust store" "define revocation as a registry layer distinct from CID immutability" "unify kotoba(custody epoch / CACAO exp) and aiueos(ed25519 signer) key lifecycle" "decision engine: signature_valid AND not_expired AND not_revoked AND issuer_trusted_for"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "kotoba-aiueos-security", :adr/related ["90-docs/adr/2606290930-kotoba-aiueos-capability-bridge.edn" "orgs/kotoba-lang/aiueos/SECURITY.md" "orgs/kotoba-lang/aiueos/src/policy.rs" "orgs/kotoba-lang/aiueos/src/signing.rs" "orgs/kotoba-lang/kotoba/crates/kotoba-auth" "orgs/kotoba-lang/kotoba/crates/kotoba-custody"], :adr/status "proposed", :adr/id "adr-2606290900-kotoba-aiueos-key-lifecycle-revocation", :adr/gap "{:source \"audit 2026-06-29\", :aiueos {:signer-registry \"flat BTreeMap<id,hex-pubkey>\", :missing [:expiry :revocation :rotation :chain], :security-md-quote \"A compromised signer key can only be handled by editing the policy\"}, :kotoba {:present [:cacao-exp :custody-epoch-rotation :pre-revocation-warrant-gossipsub], :missing [:live-revocation-registry-over-grants-and-signers]}, :principle \"CID is immutable; a bad hash stays referenceable forever. Revocation needs a separate layer.\"}", :adr/maturity "[{:stage :K0, :deliverable [\"CACAO exp\" \"custody epoch rotation\"], :status :implemented, :where \"kotoba\"} {:stage :K1, :deliverable [\"aiueos signer trust store\" \"valid_from/until\" \"status active|rotated|revoked\"], :status :next} {:stage :K2, :deliverable [\"revocation registry warrant list\" \"target=CID/key\"], :status :next} {:stage :K3, :deliverable [\"decision engine 3-condition check in aiueos broker + kotoba auth\"], :status :after-k1-k2} {:stage :K4, :deliverable [\"rotation chain\" \"delegation depth>2\" \"PQ signature migration\"], :status :future}]", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-06-29", :adr/body "\n# ADR-2606290900: 鍵ライフサイクルと失効レイヤを CID 不変性から分離する\n\n**Status**: proposed\n**Date**: 2026-06-29\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki\n\n## Context\n\n監査(2026-06-29)で、提案アーキテクチャの最重要不足点が確認された:\n\n- **aiueos**: signer registry は `policy.signers: BTreeMap<String,String>`(id→hex pubkey)の\n  **flat list**。expiry / revocation / rotation / chain が無く、SECURITY.md も\n  「A compromised signer key can only be handled by editing the policy」と明記する。\n- **kotoba**: custody の epoch rotation(`re_deal_shares_to_new_set`)と CACAO `exp` は\n  あるが、配布済みの grant / signer / artifact を「いま信じない」と宣言する\n  **live revocation registry** が無い。\n- **content address の本質的制約**: CID は immutable なので、悪い hash を永遠に正しく\n  参照できる。失効は CID だけでは表現できず、別レイヤが要る(「hash は記憶力が良すぎる」)。\n\n## Decision\n\n**信頼判定を `signature_valid ∧ not_expired ∧ not_revoked` の 3 条件に統一し、\n`not_revoked` を CID 不変性とは独立した失効レイヤとして導入する。**\n\n1. **signer registry を trust store へ昇格**(aiueos): flat list を、各エントリが\n   `valid_from` / `valid_until` / `status(active|rotated|revoked)` / `rotated_to` を\n   持つ versioned store に置き換える。policy 編集なしに失効を反映できる。\n\n2. **revocation registry を新設**(kotoba 正本 / aiueos 参照): 失効対象を CID/鍵で指す\n   append-only な warrant 列。target は grant-CID / signer-key-id / artifact-CID / manifest-CID\n   のいずれか。entry は `{target, reason, issuer-did, issued-at, epoch}`。既存の\n   kotoba PRE revocation warrant(GossipSub)と custody epoch を上位概念として束ねる。\n\n3. **失効の意味論は「消去」ではなく「不採用」**: 配布済み ciphertext / artifact は\n   消さない(消せない)。decision engine が参照時に registry を引き、revoked なら deny。\n   kotoba-rad(ADR-2606280300)の「revocation = epoch rotation, not deletion」と同原則。\n\n4. **expiry の既定**: CACAO は `exp` 必須化を推奨し、無い場合の fallback\n   (`MAX_CACAO_AGE_SECS = 7d`)を維持。aiueos signer も `valid_until` 既定を設ける。\n\n## Trust decision (normative)\n\n```\ntrust(subject) :=\n     signature_valid(subject)                 // ed25519 / EdDSA / CACAO chain\n  && now ∈ [valid_from, valid_until)           // expiry\n  && not revoked(subject.id | subject.cid)     // revocation registry\n  && issuer_trusted_for(subject.resource)      // authority scoping\n```\n\n`issuer_trusted_for` は「誰でも graphA/write を署名できる」状態を禁じる(電子落書き防止)。\n\n## Maturity\n\n| Stage | Deliverable | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| K0 | CACAO exp + custody epoch rotation | implemented (kotoba) |\n| K1 | aiueos signer trust store (valid_from/until, status) | next |\n| K2 | revocation registry (warrant 列, target=CID/key) | next |\n| K3 | decision engine が 3 条件で判定(aiueos broker + kotoba auth) | after K1/K2 |\n| K4 | rotation chain / delegation chain depth>2 + PQ 署名移行 | future |\n\n## Consequences\n\n- aiueos broker の `authenticate()` / `verify_one` が registry 参照を追加する分、\n  ロード時 I/O が増える。registry は CID 固定でキャッシュ可能。\n- 失効は「忘れる仕組み」なので append-only registry 自体の権威(誰が warrant を出せるか)を\n  `issuer_trusted_for` で縛る必要がある。これは ADR-2606290930 の正規化ブリッジと連動。\n- 既存 manifest 署名(`\"{id}\\n{wasm_sha256}\"` over ed25519)は不変。trust store は\n  その検証結果に対する有効性レイヤとして上に乗る。", :adr/decision "{:trust-conditions [:signature-valid :not-expired :not-revoked :issuer-trusted-for], :revocation-semantics \"non-adoption, not deletion; distributed ciphertext/artifact is not erased\", :registry-target [:grant-cid :signer-key-id :artifact-cid :manifest-cid], :registry-entry [:target :reason :issuer-did :issued-at :epoch], :authority \"issuer_trusted_for binds who may issue a revocation warrant\"}", :db/id -1, :adr/trust-decision "{:formula \"signature_valid && now in [valid_from,valid_until) && !revoked(id|cid) && issuer_trusted_for(resource)\", :purpose \"forbid anyone from signing graphA/write (no electronic graffiti)\"}", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2606290900: key lifecycle and revocation layer separated from CID immutability", :adr/source-format "edn"}]